"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.54</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4.46</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. An estimate just past the\nthreshold is weak evidence once the threshold is taken into account, and\nthe selective interval includes zero.</p>","file":"ch29-model-selection/05-selection-bias.html"}